      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cb-89d6-77ac-b08b-c7225b25c96c -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 Quickstart worker leaves the scheduled report pending\n\nThis change schedules jobs on `report-dispatch`, but the [`README.md`](https://github.com/Pratik8445/bench-run-proofline/blob/fcb0c2a94196532d3d49af8d99d731474b00c1c2/README.md?plain=1#L6-L8) quickstart runs the worker on `reports`.\n\nOn a fresh database, the worker delivers zero jobs and the summary shows one pending report.\n\nUpdate the quickstart worker command to use `--queue report-dispatch`.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202ca-af94-7709-b8b9-4b9c9a56870b/findings/01a202cb-89da-75ef-944a-555bf38f8729)"
